 "remarks": "Fully renovated and gorgeous! Sunny corner unit in quiet brick condo building in downtown Stamford. Just one block to parks, restaurants and shopping. Hardwood floors, brand new white kitchen and updated bathroom. Heat, hot water, gas and reserved parking included in rent. Laundry on site on ground level. Second parking space available for rent for $125. No extra charges for trash, water or amenities. Smaller building allows for easy access to your car in 5 minutes. Concrete, brick and steel construction buffers the sound between units for a quiet peaceful lifestyle. Excellent credit and references required. Terrific management and landlord.",
